th":13.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":65,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":6,"sumOfMeToo":15,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":13.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"950205360740192257","date":1515381586000,"rawContent":"For too long, women have not been heard or believed if they dared to speak their truth to the power of those men. But their time is up. ~Oprah #GoldenGlobes #TimesUp #MeToo","userId":119972954,"media":null,"username":"ReignOfApril","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":14.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":65,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":6,"sumOfMeToo":16,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":14.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"950206236800274432","date":1515381795000,"rawContent":"I want all the girls watching to know a new day is on the horizon. When that new day finally dawns, it will be because a lot of women &amp; men are fighting hard to make sure that they become the leaders who take us to the time that no one has to say #MeToo again.~Oprah #GoldenGlobes","userId":119972954,"media":null,"username":"ReignOfApril","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":15.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":65,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":6,"sumOfMeToo":17,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":15.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"951486172265570304","date":1515686955000,"rawContent":"#MeToo #TimesUp https:\/\/t.co\/idFzLKcKOO","userId":119972954,"media":null,"username":"ReignOfApril","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":16.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":65,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":6,"sumOfMeToo":18,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":16.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"954445620630048768","date":1516392543000,"rawContent":"~@octaviaspencer discusses #MeToo: It started with Anita Hill. Then there was a lag. But Human Resources had to discuss what sexual harassment was. But HR protects the company, not employees. #MeToo is about holding people accountable. #Sundance","userId":119972954,"media":null,"username":"ReignOfApril","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":15.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":65,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":6,"sumOfMeToo":19,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":15.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"954446294788947973","date":1516392704000,"rawContent":"There are millions of Harvey Weinstein\u2019s that continue to be dominant in the workplace. If not for collective unity through unions, women would not have been able to fight back. Images on screen play a huge part in the #MeToo issue. ~@patrickgaspard #Sundance","userId":119972954,"media":null,"username":"ReignOfApril","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":true,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":16.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":65,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":6,"sumOfMeToo":20,"sumOfClimate":0,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":16.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"954450477541834752","date":1516393701000,"rawContent":"~@octaviaspencer: The #MeToo movement can\u2019t become women vs men but about people being abused. We must hold specific individuals accountable. But we can\u2019t rush to judgement. There is power in numbers. Believe people who live w\/ the shame. #Sundance","userId":119972954,"media":null,"username":"ReignOfApril","containsBlackLivesMatter":false,"containsBlueLivesMatter":fal